{
  "id": "christmas",
  "name": "Christmas (Evergreen & Gold)",
  "description": "Seasonal: evergreen and gold. A pine header with a gold double rule over an ivory page (light) or a deep-pine page (dark), Prata headlines, cranberry for actions. Worn in both modes (owner, Nov 2026); seasonal-themes.css adds the gold rule and the pine header.",
  "notes": {
    "--btn-primary-text": "White on cranberry #b42232 (about 6.6:1), the action in both modes.",
    "--color-primary": "Cranberry in light; gold #c4a15a in dark, because cranberry is under 3:1 on pine (and #c4a15a still carries white once the draft timer darkens it 70%). Buttons stay cranberry in both via --btn-primary-bg.",
    "--on-league-accent": "Dark accent is gold, so its text is pine, not white.",
    "--hero-accent": "Leading-score text on the live hero: gold dark enough for the white card in light, bright gold on pine in dark."
  },
